    "facts": "This Criminal Petition, under Section 482 Cr.P.C., has been filed by the petitioner/sole accused to quash the proceedings in Crime No.104 of 2020 of Muppalla Police Station registered for the offences punishable under sections 270, 273 of IPC and Sections 58, 59 and 63 of Food Safety and Standards Act,2006. 2. It is reported by the Learned Special Assistant Public Prosecutor that police have conducted investigation and filed charge sheet in the court below on 12.06.2023.",
